### Rulings on the 4 directed questions
1. **User-authorized test-edit scope respected (transport-only, no weakening)? — YES.** My own `git diff -- '*.service.test.ts' | grep '^-.*(expect|it|describe|toBe|rejects|resolves|toThrow)'` returned **ZERO removed assertion lines**; `git diff '*.test.ts' | grep '^\+' | grep '.skip|.only|.todo'` returned **NONE**. qa's 21-row per-line audit (all "SAME? = yes") is confirmed at the diff level. Edits are exactly the ADR-044-sanctioned `mockRejectedValue(uniqueViolation())`→`mockResolvedValue(err(...))` transport swaps + tsconfig-forced dead-helper/import cleanup. Within scope.
