### Schema Changes (prisma/schema.prisma)
- Added `enum AuditTargetType { task url user blocklist_entry }` (native enum, after `FlagState`).
- Added `model AuditLog` (after `FlaggedUrl`) → `@@map("audit_logs")`. Fields (camelCase →
