  `metadata Json @default("{}") @db.JsonB`, `createdAt @default(now()) @db.Timestamptz(3)`.
  **NO `updatedAt`. NO FK relations** (no `User @relation`, and **no back-relation
  `auditLogs AuditLog[]` added to `User`** → no cascade, rows survive user delete = S7).
- 4 `@@index`: `[createdAt(Desc)]`, `[eventType, createdAt(Desc)]`, `[actorId, createdAt(Desc)]`,
  `[targetId, createdAt(Desc)]`. NO index on target_type / ip / ua / metadata (ADR-023/024).
