3. **FIRE-AND-FORGET (S5/S8)** — record() returns void, fires insert without await; when repo.insert REJECTS, record() does NOT throw and AUDIT_WRITE_FAILED is logged once with {event,action,actorId,err}; when insert resolves, error() is NOT called. Integration write-through proves a real admin mutation persists the row and the read API returns it.
